# Contract Intelligence Platform — agent rules

Read [docs/FOUNDATION_AUDIT_2026-08-20.md](../docs/FOUNDATION_AUDIT_2026-08-20.md), [docs/MASTER_BLUEPRINT.md](../docs/MASTER_BLUEPRINT.md), [docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md](../docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md), [docs/CURRENT_STATE_AUDIT.md](../docs/CURRENT_STATE_AUDIT.md), and [docs/WORK_TRAIL.md](../docs/WORK_TRAIL.md) before implementing. After any session that ships, blocks, or changes direction, update `docs/WORK_TRAIL.md` and keep it consistent with the foundation audit. Do not leave platform status only in chat.

