## Product phases

- **Canonical product phases 1–8** govern product maturity ([BUILD_PLAN.md](../docs/BUILD_PLAN.md)).
- Optional commercialization is **not** a core product phase. Architecture is **multi-tenant-ready from day one**.
- **Legacy engineering IDs 0–14** stay on migrations and `PHASE*_ACCEPTANCE.md` — do not rename.
- **Legacy Phase 2 (RLS/tenancy) is Foundation (canonical Phase 1), not the Historical Pilot.**
- **Canonical Phase 2 = Historical Pilot** (~20–30 packages). Status: **~7 A/B through pipeline; exit unmet** — see [FOUNDATION_AUDIT_2026-08-20.md](../docs/FOUNDATION_AUDIT_2026-08-20.md). Do not say “0 packages” and do not say “pilot complete.”
- Passing an acceptance/`VERIFY*` script does **not** mean the corresponding product phase is complete for L&P operators.
- Do not say “canonical phases 1–9.” Response / Submission / Result is **Phase 8**.

## What not to build

- Not a CRM: no leads, contact cadence, sales activities, client-facing auth, client portal, or customer self-service.
- `clients` / buyers = buyer/agency procurement intelligence, not CRM accounts.
- Do not fabricate procurement intelligence, analytics, or reports without verified evidence.
- Do not claim a feature is complete because a route, table, or VERIFY PASS exists.
- Do not invent L&P prices, staffing, performance metrics, or loss reasons.
- Do not auto-promote AI extraction to canonical.

## Early UX — early / partial / unvalidated

Intelligence / Ask / Market / Reports / pursuit / pricing / response shells may exist ahead of the verified corpus. **Do not expand as finished product** until Historical Pilot validates the model. Reconcile to IA: **Home | Pursuits | Intelligence | Contracts | Data Ops** (Ask GPT in header; Data Ops owns Intake). Do not delete useful early code.

## Architecture lock

Preserve: Supabase Storage vault, Vercel Workflow lifecycle, JobPort, Supabase Cron, PDF.js, openpyxl, AI Gateway abstraction, pgvector in Postgres. Web-only Vercel deploy. FastAPI processor stays off Vercel until explicitly hosted elsewhere. No Prisma/Drizzle, Pinecone, or LangGraph-for-ingest.

